1
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:08,710
What do you do in your free time?

2
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:20,680
OK, we know you all like watching TV and playing computer games, but we want to know some of the other things you do when you've got some free time.

3
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:23,210
Right, and let us know.

4
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:25,200
Hermione.

5
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,320
I love cats!

6
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:33,100
I like watching cat videos on YouTube every day.

7
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:42,890
I love taking photos of them, too, cats that I see when I'm outside - I try to get photos of lots of different kinds.

8
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:50,630
And I collect things with cats on them - you know, cards or notebooks or T-shirts, things like that.

9
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:55,520
But we can't have cats at home because my dad can't stand them!

10
00:00:57,630 --> 00:00:58,070
Andy.

11
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:11,560
I can't stand having nothing to do - for example, when I wait for the bus or in the queue at the fast food place - so I always have my puzzle app on my mobile.

12
00:01:12,750 --> 00:01:22,260
Sometimes it's Sudoku, sometimes a crossword or different word game, but it doesn't matter - I just love doing puzzles.

13
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:25,480
And it's great because I never get bored.

14
00:01:27,770 --> 00:01:28,250
Natalie.

15
00:01:29,890 --> 00:01:38,670
I'm usually busy, but occasionally I've got a bit of free time, especially in the evening after I do my homework.

16
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:43,260
My favourite thing is looking at maps online.

17
00:01:44,330 --> 00:01:49,450
I like using 'street view' and I imagine myself walking in a street somewhere.

18
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:56,160
My dream is to go to New York, so I often 'walk' in the streets there.

19
00:01:57,280 --> 00:02:01,580
I try and visit a different place in the world at least once a week.

20
00:02:03,830 --> 00:02:04,310
Lucy.

21
00:02:05,820 --> 00:02:17,000
I don't really like sport - I hate running and doing exercise and all that - but I'm crazy about the New Zealand rugby team, the All Blacks.

22
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:26,990
It's because my uncle and aunt live there and they love rugby, so I watch the games and collect anything I can about them!

23
00:02:27,790 --> 00:02:32,290
I have a book that I put photos and newspaper articles in.

24
00:02:32,810 --> 00:02:38,310
Once a week my uncle and I talk on the internet about the All Blacks - I love that!
